      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "alt": "TQMT1022 board",
      "text": "<h1>Power Architecture® Module with QorIQ® T1040 processor by NXP</h1>\n<p>The embedded module TQMT1040 together with the other pin compatible variants of the T-Series modules forms the next generation of the well-known NXP QorIQ® product family TQMP1020/2020. Based on the T-Series processors, new applications are opening up in industrial applications as well as in communication.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Aug 28 2026 22:55:27 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
